} </style> <div class=\"bantu\" style=\"background:url(../../../../static/home/tu/tu2.jpg) no-repeat center center\"> <div class=\"ban_z\"> <div class=\"container\"> <p class=\"wow fadeInUp\">解决方案</p> </div> </div> </div> <div class=\"al_t\" style=\"background:#fff;\"> <div class=\"al_xq\"> <div class=\"alxq_l\"> <h2>解决方案</h2> <ul> <li class=\"\"><a href=\"592.html\">GreatDB替代MySQL解决方案</a></li> <li class=\"\"><a href=\"593.html\">GreatDB替代Oracle解决方案</a></li> <li class=\"\"><a href=\"594.html\">数据库两地三中心解决方案</a></li> <li class=\"\"><a href=\"595.html\">数据库上云解决方案</a></li> <li class=\"\"><a href=\"596.html\">多业务数据库整合解决方案</a></li> <li class=\"\"><a href=\"276.html\">电力监控系统解决方案</a></li> <li class=\"bg\"><a href=\"234.html\">国家突发事件预警系统</a></li> <li class=\"\"><a href=\"128.html\">能源行业协同机制信息管理平台解决方案</a></li> </ul> </div> <div class=\"alxq_r\"> <div class=\"al_dhx\"> <h2>国家突发事件预警系统</h2> <h1 style=\"white-space: normal; font-size: 32px; border-bottom: 2px solid rgb(204, 204, 204); padding: 0px 4px 0px 0px; margin: 0px 0px 10px;\">一、项目背景</h1><p style=\"font-size: medium; white-space: normal; text-align: justify; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif; line-height: 1.5em;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 16px; font-family: 楷体, 楷体_GB2312, SimKai;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;</span><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: 微软雅黑, sans-serif; font-size: 16px;\">国家突发公共事件预警信息发布系统通过建立一个权威、客观、畅通、可信的渠道，让公众了解事件的现状、进展、趋势、原因等信息，有利于消除公众疑虑，避免引起混乱。项目包括国家级预警信息发布管理平台、省级发布管理平台、地市级发布管理平台以及县级发布管理终端四级体系，国家级预警信息发布管理平台主要实现国家突发公共事件预警信息的接收、处理、存储和发布。</span><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 16px; font-family: 楷体, 楷体_GB2312, SimKai;\"><br/></span></span></p><p style=\"white-space: normal;\"><span style=\"font-family: 楷体, 楷体_GB2312, SimKai; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><br/></span></p><p style=\"font-size: medium; white-space: normal; line-height: 21.12px;\"><span style=\"font-family: 楷体, 楷体_GB2312, SimKai; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"></span></p><h1 style=\"white-space: normal; font-size: 32px; border-bottom: 2px solid rgb(204, 204, 204); padding: 0px 4px 0px 0px; margin: 0px 0px 10px;\">二、建设方案</h1><p style=\"white-space: normal;\"><span style=\"font-family: 楷体, 楷体_GB2312, SimKai; font-size: 24px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"></span></p><p style=\"white-space: normal; text-align: justify; font-size: 14px; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif; text-indent: 28px; line-height: 1.5em;\"><span style=\"font-family: 微软雅黑, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">&nbsp;项目采用GreatDB 分布式数据库支撑国家级预警信息发布管理平台建设，存储从各省及部委单位收集的公共事件预警信息，并基于数据库处理引擎和技术，支持应用端的预警信息发布和查询。</span></p><p style=\"white-space: normal; text-align: justify; font-size: 14px; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif; text-indent: 28px; line-height: 1.5em;\"><span style=\"font-family: 微软雅黑, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"></span></p><p style=\"font-size: medium; white-space: normal; line-height: 21.12px;\"><img src=\"../../../../ueditor/php/upload/image/20210423/1619149510337323.jpg\" title=\"1619149510337323.jpg\" alt=\"气象局.jpg\"/></p><p style=\"font-size: medium; white-space: normal; line-height: 21.12px;\"><br/></p><h1 style=\"white-space: normal; font-size: 32px; border-bottom: 2px solid rgb(204, 204, 204); padding: 0px 4px 0px 0px; margin: 0px 0px 10px;\">三、核心亮点</h1><p style=\"white-space: normal; text-align: justify; font-size: 14px; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif; text-indent: 28px; line-height: 1.5em;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Wingdings;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif;\"><strong style=\"font-family: DengXian; font-size: 14px; text-align: justify; text-wrap: wrap;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px; line-height: 24px; font-family: 微软雅黑, sans-serif;\">·&nbsp;</span></strong>&nbsp;</span><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 9px; line-height: normal;\"></span></span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 16px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: 微软雅黑, sans-serif;\">高稳定：</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 16px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: 微软雅黑, sans-serif;\">连续稳定运行超过5年，为国家级预警发布平台提供稳定保障</span></span></p><p style=\"white-space: normal; text-align: justify; font-size: 14px; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif; text-indent: 28px; line-height: 1.5em;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 16px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: 微软雅黑, sans-serif;\"><strong style=\"font-family: DengXian; font-size: 14px; text-align: justify; text-wrap: wrap;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px; line-height: 24px; font-family: 微软雅黑, sans-serif;\">·&nbsp;</span></strong>高性能：</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 16px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: 微软雅黑, sans-serif;\">良好体现性能体现，每秒支撑超过1000次数据访问</span></span></p><p style=\"white-space: normal; text-align: justify; font-size: 14px; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif; text-indent: 28px; line-height: 1.5em;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 16px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: 微软雅黑, sans-serif;\"><strong style=\"font-family: DengXian; font-size: 14px; text-align: justify; text-wrap: wrap;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px; line-height: 24px; font-family: 微软雅黑, sans-serif;\">·&nbsp;</span></strong>高运维：</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 16px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: 微软雅黑, sans-serif;\">实现集中管控，为用户的运维管理工作提供便捷性</span></span></p><p style=\"white-space: normal; text-align: justify; font-size: 14px; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif; text-indent: 28px; line-height: 1.5em;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><strong style=\"font-family: sans-serif; font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 16px; font-family: 微软雅黑, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif;\"><strong style=\"font-family: DengXian; font-size: 14px; text-align: justify; text-wrap: wrap;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px; line-height: 24px; font-family: 微软雅黑, sans-serif;\">·&nbsp;</span></strong></span>高安全</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 16px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: 微软雅黑, sans-serif;\">：支撑国家级数据存储与信息处理，实现数据强一致，保证故障恢复后不丢数据。</span></span></p><p style=\"font-size: medium; white-space: normal; line-height: 1.5em;\"><br/></p><p style=\"font-size: medium; white-space: normal; line-height: 21.12px;\"><span style=\"font-family: 微软雅黑, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"></span></p><h1 style=\"font-size: 32px; font-weight: bold; border-bottom: 2px solid rgb(204, 204, 204); padding: 0px 4px 0px 0px; text-align: left; margin: 0px 0px 10px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 32px;\">四、项目意义</span></h1><p><br/></p><p style=\"font-size: medium; white-space: normal; text-align: justify; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif; line-height: 1.5em;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 16px; font-family: 微软雅黑, sans-serif;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;国家预警平台，通过使用万里<a>数据库GreatDB</a>，处理公共预警事件的接收、处理、存储和发布，实现真正的国产自主可控。万里数据库GreatDB也为国家级预警发布平台提供包括性能、稳定性和运维等多个方面的价值。</span></p><p><br/></p> </div> </div> </div> </div> <div class=\"footer\"> <div class=\"container\"> <div class=\"foot_t\"> <div class=\"foot_tl\"> <ul> <h2><a href=\"../../../../product.html\">产品</a></h2> <li><a href=\"../../../../product/cid/45.html\">安全数据库集中式</a> <li><a href=\"../../../../product/cid/2.html\">安全数据库分布式</a> <li><a href=\"../../../../product/cid/3.html\">数据库管理平台</a> <li><a href=\"../../../../product/cid/47.html\">数据迁移服务平台</a> </ul> <ul> <h2><a href=\"../../../../news/cid/52.html\">解决方案</a></h2> </ul> <ul> <h2><a href=\"../../../../case.html\">客户案例</a></h2> <li><a href=\